title: Herman_LoadPhase
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase_Herman = "">>
<<setPhase Herman>>
<<if $dialoguePhase_Herman == "begin">>
<<jump Herman_Begin01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_Herman == "comeback">>
<<jump Herman_Comeback01>>
<<else>>
Herman: Maybe you should make some dialogue before crossing that gap.
<<endif>>
===
title: Herman_Begin01
---
<<camMove Herman_CamRig "npc">>
Herman: I'd be careful if I were you.
Herman: This gap looks unforgiving.
<<camMove Herman_CamRig "pc">>
You: Woah, deadly even?
<<camMove Herman_CamRig "npc">>
Herman: Well as deadly as a narrative-driven game can be.
Herman: Watch your step.
<<camMove Herman_CamRig "pc">>
You: Will do.
<<camMove Herman_CamRig "return">>
<<getPhase Herman "comeback">>
===
title: Herman_Comeback01
---
<<camMove Herman_CamRig "npc">>
Herman: If you're thinking this challenge is impossible, it probably is.
Herman: I mean, how worth it can virtual cats be anyway?
<<camMove Herman_CamRig "return">>
===